{
  "slug": "algovault-skills",
  "name": "Algovault Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Brain Layer for AI Trading Agents. 20 Skills over the AlgoVault MCP — composite BUY/SELL/HOLD signals across 5 crypto exchanges, funding-rate arbitrage, and market regime classification. Track record: 90.5% PFE win rate across 90K+ signals, Merkle-anchored on Base L2.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `agent-portfolio-rebalance` (Agent Portfolio Rebalance — Daily regime check for each asset in your portfolio), `contrarian-meme-scanner` (Contrarian Meme Scanner — Scan lower-tier assets for contrarian setups: high-confidence SELL calls during an uptrend may signal…), `cross-asset-correlation` (Cross-Asset Correlation — Get trade calls for BTC, ETH, SOL simultaneously), `divergence-detector` (Divergence Detector — Compare trade call direction vs market regime), `full-3-tool-pipeline` (Full 3-Tool Pipeline — The complete AlgoVault workflow: regime detection, trade call, then arb check for the same…), `funding-arb-monitor` (Funding Arb Monitor — Scan for cross-venue funding rate arbitrage opportunities), `funding-cash-and-carry` (Funding Cash-and-Carry — Find a funding arb spread, then get a trade call on the long side), `funding-sentiment-dashboard` (Funding Sentiment Dashboard — Get market regime for major assets and use the cross-venue funding sentiment to gauge…), and 12 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `algovault`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install algovault-skills@claude-community` from `AlgoVaultLabs/algovault-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 20,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
